bian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00002.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2024/CVE-2024-57946.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bb04e7276eb5376f975ca811b9a340d0d55b901d/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57946.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-57946","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-57946.yaml","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/acf4fca32ae3e6d7d43276d798ba52a241ef3b49/2024/CVE-2024-57946.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/d2b9f82473296f370428cbc110ec5b988e3fd692/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57946.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/027c37e8e73e99b2a68cafab2e6594bde5db273e/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-57946.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/31d5b78ee7ad856a6aee490403faecefdc8a4878/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-57946-2025-11-03-1452","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/724a585dd64bbf0d8e6760dd16b808140e9a0dd8/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-hgm3-gq5f-vjwg/GHSA-hgm3-gq5f-vjwg.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-57946"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0649.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0648","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0648.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57945","title":"Linux Linux 内核 RISC-V 架构 vmemmap 地址越界读取漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 RISC-V 架构的稀疏 vmemmap 模型中存在越界读取漏洞。当 phys_ram_base 未按内存 section 大小对齐时，vmemmap 虚拟地址计算会产生低于 VMEMMAP_START 的错误地址，导致内核在初始化 struct page 时访问非法内存区域。本地低权限攻击者可利用此漏洞读取敏感内核内存信息或触发系统崩溃，造成机密性泄露和拒绝服务。该漏洞影响所有使用稀疏 vmemmap 模型的 RISC-V Linux 内核版本，CVSS 评分 7.1，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.1,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57945"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-21T13:15:09Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:17Z","remediation":"立即升级 Linux 内核至以下修复版本：5.10.258、6.1.140、6.6.72、6.12.10 及以上版本，或合入对应稳定分支补丁（commit 043503044280、92f08673d3f1、a4a7ac3d2660、d2bd51954ac8、f754f27e98f8）。对于 Debian/Ubuntu 系统，安装对应安全更新（DSA-5925、USN-7381-1、USN-7514-1）。该漏洞为本地利用，无法立即打补丁时可通过限制本地用户登录作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/04350304428063da6a55a8a4597d409dc69148b2","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/92f08673d3f1893191323572f60e3c62f2e57c2f","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/a4a7ac3d266008018f05fae53060fcb331151a14","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d2bd51954ac8377c2f1eb1813e694788998add66","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f754f27e98f88428aaf6be6e00f5cbce97f62d4b","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/08/msg00010.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2024/CVE-2024-57945.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bb04e7276eb5376f975ca811b9a340d0d55b901d/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57945.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-57945","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-57945.yaml","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/acf4fca32ae3e6d7d43276d798ba52a241ef3b49/2024/CVE-2024-57945.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/027c37e8e73e99b2a68cafab2e6594bde5db273e/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-57945.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/31d5b78ee7ad856a6aee490403faecefdc8a4878/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-57945-2025-11-03-1304","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/050b62cac636d83be07e6d4c77e70114e1ca7c93/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-57945.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2024-57945.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/724a585dd64bbf0d8e6760dd16b808140e9a0dd8/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-743f-m6p2-83h6/GHSA-743f-m6p2-83h6.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0648.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0647","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0647.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57940","title":"Linux Kernel exfat 文件系统无限循环拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 exfat 文件系统驱动中存在无限循环漏洞（CWE-835），当文件系统被恶意构造导致簇链中的某个簇指向自身时，exfat_readdir() 函数在遍历目录项时无法正确递增 dentry 计数器，导致循环无法正常退出。该漏洞使得 s_lock 无法释放，进而引发 exfat_sync_fs() 等其他任务挂起，造成系统拒绝服务。攻击者需要本地低权限访问，通过挂载特制的 exfat 文件系统镜像即可触发该漏洞，影响所有使用受影响 Linux 内核版本的系统。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57940"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-21T13:15:08Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:16Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 6.13 及以上版本（commit fee873761bd9）。Debian 用户：bullseye 升级至 5.10.259-1，bookworm 升级至 6.1.177-1，trixie 升级至 6.12.96-1。Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 用户：更新至 linux-image-6.11.0-1011-lowlatency（USN-7381-1）。临时缓解措施：避免挂载来源不可信的 exFAT 文件系统镜像。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/28c21f0ac5293a4bf19b3e0e32005d6dd31a6c17","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/31beabd0f47f8c3ed9965ba861c9e5b252d4920a","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d8cfbb8723bd3d3222f360227a1cc15227189ca6","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d9ea94f5cd117d56e573696d0045ab3044185a15","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/dc1d7afceb982e8f666e70a582e6b5aa806de063","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/fee873761bd978d077d8c55334b4966ac4cb7b59","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00002.html","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-265688.html","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-503939.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2024/CVE-2024-57940.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bb04e7276eb5376f975ca811b9a340d0d55b901d/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57940.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-57940.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-57940","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/acf4fca32ae3e6d7d43276d798ba52a241ef3b49/2024/CVE-2024-57940.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/027c37e8e73e99b2a68cafab2e6594bde5db273e/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-57940.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/31d5b78ee7ad856a6aee490403faecefdc8a4878/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-57940-2025-11-03-1452","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/050b62cac636d83be07e6d4c77e70114e1ca7c93/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-57940.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/724a585dd64bbf0d8e6760dd16b808140e9a0dd8/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-8pw9-7gv3-535c/GHSA-8pw9-7gv3-535c.json","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/02/18/seguranca/cve-2024-57940-exfat-fix-the-infinite-loop-in-exfa-1771410750000.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0647.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0646","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0646.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57939","title":"Linux kernel RISC-V 架构 die() 函数自旋锁上下文休眠拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 RISC-V 架构的 die() 函数中存在原子上下文休眠漏洞。die() 函数可在异常处理程序中被调用，此时上下文处于原子态（in_atomic），不允许休眠。然而 die() 使用了 spinlock_t 自旋锁，在启用了 PREEMPT_RT 抢占式实时内核配置下，spinlock_t 会被实现为可休眠锁，导致在原子上下文中调用时触发内核调度器 BUG 警告，表现为系统崩溃或拒绝服务。本地低权限攻击者可通过触发非法指令异常（illegal instruction）等途径，诱使内核进入 die() 路径，从而引发该问题。该漏洞影响 RISC-V 架构的 Linux 内核，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。修复方式为改用 raw_spinlock_t，该锁在 PREEMPT_RT 下也不会休眠。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57939"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-21T13:15:07Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:16Z","remediation":"立即将 Linux 内核升级至以下修复版本：5.10.234+、5.15.177+、6.1.125+、6.6.72+、6.12.10+ 或 6.13+。对于使用 PREEMPT_RT 的 RISC-V 系统，可通过 `git cherry-pick 8c38baa03ac8` 等补丁提交将 `die()` 中的 `spinlock_t` 替换为 `raw_spinlock_t`。如无法立即升级，可临时禁用 PREEMPT_RT 内核配置作为缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/10c24df2e303f517fab0359392c11b6b1d553f2b","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/6a97f4118ac07cfdc316433f385dbdc12af5025e","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/76ab0afcdbe8c9685b589016ee1c0e25fe596707","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/8c38baa03ac8e18140faf36a3b955d30cad48e74","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/c21df31fc2a4afc02a6e56511364e9e793ea92ec","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f48f060a4b36b5e96628f6c3fb1540f1e8dedb69","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2024/CVE-2024-57939.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bb04e7276eb5376f975ca811b9a340d0d55b901d/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57939.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-57939","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-57939.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/d2b9f82473296f370428cbc110ec5b988e3fd692/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57939.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/027c37e8e73e99b2a68cafab2e6594bde5db273e/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-57939.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/31d5b78ee7ad856a6aee490403faecefdc8a4878/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-57939-2025-11-03-1440","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/7999ee41ee237a13b39c61d1f4c6711d59954ac6/CVEs/2024/CVE-2024-57939.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/724a585dd64bbf0d8e6760dd16b808140e9a0dd8/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-9pph-vqgh-3wmp/GHSA-9pph-vqgh-3wmp.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-57939"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0646.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0645","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0645.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57938","title":"Linux Kernel SCTP 整数溢出漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 SCTP 协议实现中的 sctp_association_init() 函数存在整数溢出漏洞。当系统管理员将 net.sctp.max_autoclose 参数设置为 UINT_MAX 时，该函数中的自动关闭超时计算会触发整数溢出，导致内核崩溃。具有低权限的本地攻击者可利用此漏洞造成拒绝服务（系统崩溃），影响可用性。该漏洞影响所有使用受影响 Linux 内核版本的发行版，包括 Debian 11、Ubuntu 20.04/24.04 LTS 等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57938"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-21T12:15:27Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:16Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至以下已修复版本：5.4.289、5.10.233、5.15.176、6.1.124、6.6.70、6.12.9 及以上。Debian 11 用户请安装 DLA-4075-1 安全更新；Ubuntu 24.04 用户请安装 USN-7381-1 更新。如无法立即升级，可通过 sysctl 设置 net.sctp.max_autoclose=0 禁用 SCTP 自动关闭功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/081bdb3a31674339313c6d702af922bc29de2c53","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2297890b778b0e7c8200d6818154f7e461d78e94","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/271f031f4c31c07e2a85a1ba2b4c8e734909a477","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/4e86729d1ff329815a6e8a920cb554a1d4cb5b8d","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/7af63ef5fe4d480064eb22583b24ffc8b408183a","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/94b7ed0a4896420988e1776942f0a3f67167873e","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f9c3adb083d3278f065a83c3f667f1246c74c31f","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00002.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2024/CVE-2024-57938.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bb04e7276eb5376f975ca811b9a340d0d55b901d/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57938.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-57938.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-57938","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/d2b9f82473296f370428cbc110ec5b988e3fd692/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57938.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/027c37e8e73e99b2a68cafab2e6594bde5db273e/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-57938.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/31d5b78ee7ad856a6aee490403faecefdc8a4878/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-57938-2025-11-03-1440","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-57938.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/724a585dd64bbf0d8e6760dd16b808140e9a0dd8/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-frp4-f42v-g8xw/GHSA-frp4-f42v-g8xw.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-57938"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0645.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0644","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0644.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57933","title":"Linux kernel gve 驱动空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 Google Virtual Ethernet (gve) 驱动中存在空指针解引用漏洞。当网络接口处于 down 状态时，对 XSK (AF_XDP) 池执行启用或禁用操作会导致 RX 队列指针为 NULL，从而触发空指针解引用，造成系统崩溃。本地低权限攻击者可利用此漏洞发起拒绝服务攻击。该漏洞影响使用 gve 驱动的 Linux 内核系统，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。Linux 内核社区已通过补丁修复，在操作 XSK 池前增加队列存在性检查以防范此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57933"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-21T12:15:26Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:15Z","remediation":"立即升级 Linux 内核至 6.6.70、6.12.9 或 6.13 及以上版本。Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 用户可通过 `apt update && apt install linux-image-6.11.0-1011-lowlatency` 安装 USN-7381-1 更新后重启系统。如无法立即升级，避免在网络接口 down 状态下操作 XSK（AF_XDP）池的启用或禁用，作为临时规避措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/40338d7987d810fcaa95c500b1068a52b08eec9b","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/771d66f2bd8c4dba1286a9163ab982cecd825718","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/8e8d7037c89437af12725f454e2eaf40e8166c0f","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2024/CVE-2024-57933.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bb04e7276eb5376f975ca811b9a340d0d55b901d/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57933.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-57933.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/59adead62d41f907bd4d8297210669925a301433/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57933.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-57933","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/027c37e8e73e99b2a68cafab2e6594bde5db273e/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-57933.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-57933.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/724a585dd64bbf0d8e6760dd16b808140e9a0dd8/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-qw8g-4j5w-5j26/GHSA-qw8g-4j5w-5j26.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-57933","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/050b62cac636d83be07e6d4c77e70114e1ca7c93/SSVC/data/2024/CVE-2024-57933.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0644.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0467","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0467.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-10846","title":"Docker Compose compose-go 库解析 YAML 时资源消耗漏洞","description":"compose-go 库在解析包含递归循环的 Compose 文件时存在平台资源过度消耗漏洞（CWE-20 输入验证不当），由于未对 YAML 结构的递归深度进行有效限制，导致解析过程中 CPU 和内存被大量占用。经授权的攻击者可通过发送包含递归引用的恶意 YAML 载荷触发此漏洞，造成服务拒绝。该漏洞影响 compose-go v2.1.0 至 v2.4.0 及 Docker Compose v2.27.0 至 v2.29.7 版本，CVSS 评分 5.9，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.9,"aliases":["CVE-2024-10846"],"sources":["cve","ghsa"],"published":"2025-01-21T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","remediation":"将 compose-go 库升级至 v2.4.1 或更高版本。如使用 Docker Compose，应升级至 v2.30.0 及以上版本。该漏洞无已知临时缓解措施，仅可通过升级修复。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/compose-spec/compose-go/security/advisories/GHSA-36gq-35j3-p9r9","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20250425-0008/","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a54ce91ca4eed5acb1176739213f8ac035b9fa27/cves/2024/10xxx/CVE-2024-10846.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2024/10xxx/CVE-2024-10846.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/go/github.com/compose-spec/compose-go/v2/CVE-2024-10846.yml","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2024-10846.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/54ab2d6e8edcc52192915a067c45b2190f568993/references/CVE-2024-10846-2025-04-25-2205","https://github.com/golang/vulndb/blob/05da64c166d4f0c1282a01018eb34f5a34c00175/data/reports/GO-2025-3412.yaml","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2024-10846.html","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/02/18/seguranca/cve-2024-10846-excessive-platform-resource-consump-1771411060000.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/github-reviewed/2025/01/GHSA-36gq-35j3-p9r9/GHSA-36gq-35j3-p9r9.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c30cb75c630bd0892c286bac41dd51c65d6a6546/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-10846.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0467.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0485","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0485.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-13176","title":"OpenSSL ECDSA 签名计算定时侧信道漏洞","description":"OpenSSL FIPS 模块 3.0 至 3.4 版本中的 ECDSA 签名计算存在时序侧信道漏洞。当经过逆运算的 ECDSA nonce 值最高位字为零时，会产生约 300 纳秒的时序差异，攻击者可通过精确测量签名操作的执行时间推断出私钥信息。该漏洞主要影响 NIST P-521 椭圆曲线，利用条件苛刻，攻击者需与目标位于同一物理主机或具备极低延迟的高速网络连接。CVSS 评分 4.1，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.1,"aliases":["CVE-2024-13176"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-20T14:15:26Z","updated":"2026-06-17T07:01:23Z","remediation":"升级 OpenSSL 至修复版本：3.0.x 升级至 3.0.16+，3.1.x 升级至 3.1.8+，3.2.x 升级至 3.2.4+，3.3.x 升级至 3.3.3+，3.4.0 升级至 3.4.1+。如无法立即升级，可通过限制签名操作仅允许本地受信进程访问、避免在高延迟网络环境下使用 ECDSA P-521 曲线签名来降低攻击风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/openssl/openssl/commit/07272b05b04836a762b4baa874958af51d513844","https://github.com/openssl/openssl/commit/2af62e74fb59bc469506bc37eb2990ea408d9467","https://github.com/openssl/openssl/commit/392dcb336405a0c94486aa6655057f59fd3a0902","https://github.com/openssl/openssl/commit/4b1cb94a734a7d4ec363ac0a215a25c181e11f65","https://github.com/openssl/openssl/commit/77c608f4c8857e63e98e66444e2e761c9627916f","https://github.openssl.org/openssl/extended-releases/commit/0d5fd1ab987f7571e2c955d8d8b638fc0fb54ded","https://github.openssl.org/openssl/extended-releases/commit/a2639000db19878d5d89586ae7b725080592ae86","https://openssl-library.org/news/secadv/20250120.txt","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/01/20/2","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/05/msg00028.html","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20250124-0005/","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20250418-0010/","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20250502-0006/","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-13176.md","https://github.com/openssl/openssl/blob/ba2f3b557a660cbe2a0fc0e99b1830cb930a090f/NEWS.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/5c4b2ba2a59a96457ab4b8ea4ee82efc5782bb1d/cves/2024/13xxx/CVE-2024-13176.json","https://github.com/archlinuxcn/repo/blob/ce45ab34f3eda708550319e335a10018899c42e9/archlinuxcn/openssl-1.1/CVE-2024-13176.patch","https://github.com/saltstack/salt/blob/c8f7e9ab9b833333ac9d8d3d16e31878c58aab3e/doc/topics/releases/3006.10.md","https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/2e6ec20a07f4ebfeb7d385d6c2a7f71173f514fa/pkgs/by-name/ov/ovftool/package.nix","https://github.com/RMerl/asuswrt-merlin.ng/blob/2b88ab2e96c95718b0eb9b836590129a06a3dd0b/Changelog-3006.txt","https://github.com/aquasecurity/trivy/blob/e73c76d83b609cd5c387833e2467dbb52df06e46/docs/guide/configuration/reporting.md","https://github.com/google/boringssl/blob/bbae15127720290fb1216cf5a933a4bda6abf323/docs/advisories/2025-01-21.md","https://github.com/Azure/azure-cli/blob/6e3b4eab87bc1ec9e58d76361507e9e0be27dd4f/src/azure-cli-core/HISTORY.rst"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0485.toml"}]